[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823499492","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115523#issuecomment-3823499492","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115523","id":3823499492,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j5fjk","user":{"login":"Ioennir","id":33523179,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTIzMTc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33523179?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir","html_url":"https://github.com/Ioennir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ioennir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T12:25:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T12:25:16Z","body":"Hey, I have been debugging this a bit. I haven't found the exact cause yet but I found the following:\nWithin `GameView::_show_update_window_wrapper` from Line 431 some values diverge from the first and second play.\nFor 1280x720 these are the values I've seen (commented on each line):\n```\nvoid GameView::_show_update_window_wrapper() {\n\n// ...\n\nSize2 embedded_process_min_size = get_minimum_size(); // First play: (200, 8), Second play: (200, 37)\nSize2 wrapped_margins_size = window_wrapper->get_margins_size(); // both the same (8, 8)\nSize2 wrapped_min_size = window_wrapper->get_minimum_size();  // First play: (200, 8), Second play: (200, 37)\nPoint2 offset_embedded_process = embedded_process->get_global_position() - get_global_position(); // First play: (0, 0), Second play: (0, 37)\n\nif (offset_embedded_process == Point2()) {\n\toffset_embedded_process.y = wrapped_min_size.y; // First play: enters here, Second play: doesn't enter\n}\noffset_embedded_process.x += embedded_process->get_margin_size(SIDE_LEFT);\noffset_embedded_process.y += embedded_process->get_margin_size(SIDE_TOP);\noffset_embedded_process += window_wrapper->get_margins_top_left(); // First play: (6, 14), Second play: (6, 43)\n\n//...\n\n}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823499492/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3955241961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115523#issuecomment-3955241961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115523","id":3955241961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rwDPp","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"Us