ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114852. cc @arkology \n\nNote that before the regression, the window already had different a position and size between the first run and subsequent runs (in each editor session), although the viewport dimensions were the same:\n\nFirst run | Subsequent runs\n-|-\n<img width=\"614\" height=\"777\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2381f0fc-abe1-4705-8a1a-395eff245e9c\" /> | <img width=\"614\" height=\"791\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73a6ca3e-116d-457b-8bcc-aebe41c9ad35\" />\n\nI ran the above tests with a 600x648 viewport size (and no viewport width/height override).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963087915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963883108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115523#issuecomment-3963883108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115523","id":3963883108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sRA5k","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T04:23:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T04:28:42Z","body":"> I can confirm this on Windows 11. I bisected the regression to [#114852](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114852). cc [@arkology](https://github.com/arkology)\n\nPR you mentioned reverts part of changes in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109701. Which is actually a hack and I mentioned it in PR description. Also see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113462#issuecomment-3734171045 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113462#issuecomment-3737033355.\nI still strongly believe that changes I made in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109701  have just spotted another problem existed even before my changes, but I have no clue how embedding works under hood and can not fix it by myself, sorry. At the same time I also believe that reverting https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109701 completely will be definitely not the right way to fix this problem. Even after partially reverting the changes in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114852, we again had problems with the size of the Game tab.\nAs you can reproduce issue, please try if https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115243  fixes the problem. Looks like embedded window Control node just handles container changes incorrectly.\n\n> Note that before the regression, the window already had different a position and size between the first run and subsequent runs (in each editor session), although the viewport dimensions were the same:\n\nAnd this again makes me think that the root of this problem is somewhere else.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963883108/reactions","total_count":1,"+